	<content type="text/html" mode="escaped">Author: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.smspower.org:443/forums/profile.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=27488&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;badcomputer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
	Posted: Sat Nov 07, 2026 9:53 pm (GMT 0)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class="postbody"&gt;
	&lt;blockquote&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;attribution&quot;&gt;haroldoop wrote    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;./templates/select_expand_bbcodes.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;    &lt;!--        var id = 'SXBB' + (1000 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 5000));        SXBB[id] = new _SXBB(id);        SXBB[id].T['select'] = 'Select';        SXBB[id].T['expand'] = '[+]';        SXBB[id].T['contract'] = '[-]';        SXBB[id].writeCmd();    //--&gt;    &lt;/script&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;      &lt;!--        SXBB[id].writeDiv();      //--&gt;    &lt;/script&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;attribution&quot;&gt;toxa wrote    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;./templates/select_expand_bbcodes.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;    &lt;!--        var id = 'SXBB' + (1000 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 5000));        SXBB[id] = new _SXBB(id);        SXBB[id].T['select'] = 'Select';        SXBB[id].T['expand'] = '[+]';        SXBB[id].T['contract'] = '[-]';        SXBB[id].writeCmd();    //--&gt;    &lt;/script&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;      &lt;!--        SXBB[id].writeDiv();      //--&gt;    &lt;/script&gt;AI usage should be stated in the forum topic title.    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;      &lt;!--        document.write('&lt;/div&gt;');      //--&gt;    &lt;/script&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
Nah, one thing is using the [AI] tag for games that were made using AI directly. 
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
On the other hand using the [AI] tag for a game completely made by hand that just happens to use a tool that happens to be made using AI would be misleading.    &lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;      &lt;!--        document.write('&lt;/div&gt;');      //--&gt;    &lt;/script&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
Toxa is saying this thread title should have the AI tag because the language/compiler was made with AI. He's right, and that makes sense if AI ports have to be tagged AI too.
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
Then people afterward seem to have misinterpreted that as games made with this compiler should also be tagged AI, but that's not what he was saying.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
	</content>
  </entry>
